{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs40\b\sb0\sa200\keepn EXODUS7 Buc\u259?\u539?ile de acas\u259?\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs26\i\sa220\keepn Scenariu complet pentru rescriere teatral\u259?\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs23\sa150\sl285\slmult1 Publicul acestui scenariu: copii de 5\u8211?10 ani. Versiune de lucru pentru autor, cu dialogul actual, tutorialul naratorului, toate r\u259?spunsurile alternative \u537?i \u238?ncheierea interactiv\u259?.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs23\sa150\sl285\slmult1 Autorul rescrierii: ........................................    Data: ........................\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs28\b\sb280\sa150\keepn\outlinelevel0 Cum lucrezi \u238?n acest document\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs23\sa150\sl285\slmult1 \u206?nlocuie\u537?te direct replicile de sub numele personajelor. Modific\u259? liber scenele, inten\u539?iile, umorul \u537?i finalul. Textele dintre paranteze drepte sunt indica\u539?ii pentru lucru \u537?i nu se rostesc. Numele personajelor \u537?i numerele R identific\u259? replicile; nici ele nu se citesc cu voce tare.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs23\sa150\sl285\slmult1 P\u259?streaz\u259?, dac\u259? po\u539?i, numerele R ale replicilor existente. Pentru o replic\u259? nou\u259? po\u539?i scrie R12a sau NOU. Numerotarea \u537?i reperele de la sf\u226?r\u537?it ne vor ajuta s\u259? punem ulterior noul text \u238?n aplica\u539?ie. Editarea acestui document nu schimb\u259? automat filmul, vocile sau programul.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs23\sa150\sl285\slmult1 Aceasta este versiunea complet\u259? a experien\u539?ei pentru copii. DEMO TV omite tutorialul \u537?i primirea, \u238?ncepe la num\u259?r\u259?toarea invers\u259? \u537?i folose\u537?te r\u259?spunsurile f\u259?r\u259? contribu\u539?ii; acestea sunt p\u259?strate aici al\u259?turi de toate celelalte variante.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs28\b\sb280\sa150\keepn\outlinelevel0 Personajele \u537?i spa\u539?iul de joc\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs23\sa150\sl285\slmult1 C\u258?PITANUL \u8212? conduce c\u259?l\u259?toria \u537?i vorbe\u537?te cu echipajul. Apare ca personaj 3D pe televizorul central; nu este un actor prezent fizic \u238?n sal\u259?.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs23\sa150\sl285\slmult1 AVATARUL AI \u8212? vocea de bord care explic\u259?, observ\u259? \u537?i \u238?i \u238?nso\u539?e\u537?te pe participan\u539?i. Robotul fizic nu face parte din aceast\u259? versiune.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs23\sa150\sl285\slmult1 NARATORUL \u8212? voce separat\u259?, care \u238?nt\u226?mpin\u259? publicul, explic\u259? folosirea comenzilor \u537?i invit\u259? la alegerea de final.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs23\sa150\sl285\slmult1 LUMINA \u8212? vocea primei lumi, Siwarha; ofer\u259? buc\u259?\u539?ile de lumin\u259?.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs23\sa150\sl285\slmult1 NATURA \u8212? vocea atelierului \u238?n care piesele \u238?\u537?i g\u259?sesc locul.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs23\sa150\sl285\slmult1 TEHNOLOGICUL \u8212? vocea atelierului Mann, unde este completat felinarul.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs23\sa150\sl285\slmult1 ECHIPAJUL \u8212? participan\u539?ii. Ac\u539?iunile \u537?i reac\u539?iile lor sunt libere; scenariul actual nu le impune replici rostite.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs23\sa150\sl285\slmult1 GHIDUL \u8212? persoana din sal\u259? care conduce \u238?mbarcarea \u537?i ie\u537?irea. Nu are replici \u238?nregistrate \u238?n acest pachet; autorul le poate ad\u259?uga.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Cinci televizoare alc\u259?tuiesc panorama. C\u259?pitanul apare pe cel central. Cele cinci tablete au dou\u259? locuri fiecare: A \u238?n st\u226?nga, B \u238?n dreapta, cu textul citit normal. Particip\u259? \u238?ntre una \u537?i zece persoane; locurile neocupate nu reprezint\u259? personaje absente din poveste. Valiza \u537?i felinarul sunt elemente ale pove\u537?tii, nu recuzit\u259? fizic\u259? obligatorie.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs28\b\sb280\sa150\keepn\outlinelevel0 Prologul \u206?mbarcarea \u537?i primele comenzi\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Ecran de a\u537?teptare EXODUS7. Participan\u539?ii \u238?\u537?i aleg personajele pe tablete \u537?i le confirm\u259?. Ghidul porne\u537?te tutorialul. Filmul c\u259?l\u259?toriei nu a \u238?nceput. Pauzele de aici urmeaz\u259? ac\u539?iunile participan\u539?ilor.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs22\b\sb150\sa60\keepn NARATORUL    R01\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [\u206?nt\u226?mpinarea echipajului.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs24\li240\sa180\sl300\slmult1\keep Bine a\u539?i venit la bord! \u206?nainte de plecare, nava vrea s\u259? v\u259? cunoasc\u259? pu\u539?in. Sta\u539?i lini\u537?ti\u539?i, nu v\u259? cere nicio parol\u259?.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs22\b\sb150\sa60\keepn NARATORUL    R02\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Dup\u259? introducere. Fiecare participant poate atinge lumina din jum\u259?tatea lui sau poate alege s\u259? priveasc\u259?.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs24\li240\sa180\sl300\slmult1\keep Fiecare are jum\u259?tatea lui de ecran. Atinge\u539?i lumina din fa\u539?a voastr\u259?. Dac\u259? vre\u539?i, pute\u539?i \u537?i doar s\u259? privi\u539?i.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs22\b\sb150\sa60\keepn NARATORUL    R03\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Exerci\u539?iul pentru copii. Pe tablet\u259? se alege steaua, apoi se confirm\u259?. Se a\u537?teapt\u259? participan\u539?ii activi.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs24\li240\sa180\sl300\slmult1\keep Nava a pierdut o pies\u259?. I se \u238?nt\u226?mpl\u259? mereu c\u226?nd vin musafiri. C\u259?uta\u539?i pe ecran forma care se potrive\u537?te, apoi ap\u259?sa\u539?i ca s\u259? confirma\u539?i.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs22\b\sb150\sa60\keepn NARATORUL    R04\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Fiecare participant trimite semnalul s\u259?u. \u206?ntr-o sesiune cu un singur participant este suficient semnalul acestuia; nu se a\u537?teapt\u259? locurile libere.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs24\li240\sa180\sl300\slmult1\keep Acum, to\u539?i \u238?mpreun\u259?. Atinge\u539?i semnalul de pe jum\u259?tatea voastr\u259? de ecran. Apoi privi\u539?i \u238?n fa\u539?\u259?: fiecare atingere aprinde o bucat\u259? din nav\u259?.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs22\b\sb150\sa60\keepn NARATORUL    R05\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Preg\u259?tirea pentru plecare. Ghidul confirm\u259? lansarea dup\u259? \u238?ncheierea explica\u539?iei.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs24\li240\sa180\sl300\slmult1\keep Comenzile r\u259?spund. Trage\u539?i aer \u238?n piept o clip\u259?. Privi\u539?i \u238?n fa\u539?\u259?. C\u259?l\u259?toria noastr\u259? poate s\u259? \u238?nceap\u259?.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs22\b\sb150\sa60\keepn NARATORUL    R06\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Predarea c\u259?tre C\u259?pitan. Urmeaz\u259? primirea din scenariul principal.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs24\li240\sa180\sl300\slmult1\keep Echipajul este preg\u259?tit. C\u259?pitane, de aici sunt ai dumneavoastr\u259?.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs28\b\sb280\sa150\keepn\outlinelevel0 Scena 1 Primirea la bord\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Primirea dureaz\u259? \u238?n prezent 50 de secunde, \u238?naintea filmului. Publicul este a\u537?ezat, iar C\u259?pitanul \u537?i vocea de bord prezint\u259? c\u259?utarea felinarului.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs22\b\sb150\sa60\keepn C\u258?PITANUL    R07\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Accent pe \u8222?valiz\u259? goal\u259?\u8221?; pauz\u259? scurt\u259? \u238?nainte de \u8222?drum lung\u8221?.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs24\li240\sa180\sl300\slmult1\keep Bun venit la bord! Eu sunt C\u259?pitanul. Azi avem o valiz\u259? goal\u259? \u537?i un drum lung de tot.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs22\b\sb150\sa60\keepn AVATARUL AI    R08\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Informa\u539?ie limpede; mic\u259? pauz\u259? \u238?nainte de \u8222?trei lumi\u8221?.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs24\li240\sa180\sl300\slmult1\keep \u206?n valiz\u259? \u238?ncape un felinar. Buc\u259?\u539?ile lui sunt prin trei lumi.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs22\b\sb150\sa60\keepn C\u258?PITANUL    R09\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Lini\u537?titor; apas\u259? pe \u8222?moi de lumin\u259?\u8221?, f\u259?r\u259? grab\u259?.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs24\li240\sa180\sl300\slmult1\keep Le c\u259?ut\u259?m \u238?mpreun\u259?. Nu taie, nu \u238?n\u539?eap\u259?. Sunt buc\u259?\u539?i moi de lumin\u259?.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs22\b\sb150\sa60\keepn AVATARUL AI    R10\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Instruc\u539?iune curat\u259?: st\u226?nga, dreapta, pauz\u259?, \u8222?locul lui\u8221?.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs24\li240\sa180\sl300\slmult1\keep A lucreaz\u259? \u238?n st\u226?nga tabletei, B \u238?n dreapta. Fiecare are locul lui.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs22\b\sb150\sa60\keepn C\u258?PITANUL    R11\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Accent pe \u8222?Eu r\u259?m\u226?n cu voi\u8221?; final ferm, cald.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs24\li240\sa180\sl300\slmult1\keep Pute\u539?i atinge formele. Pute\u539?i \u537?i doar s\u259? privi\u539?i. Eu r\u259?m\u226?n cu voi. C\u259?l\u259?toria \u238?ncepe oricum.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs28\b\sb280\sa150\keepn\outlinelevel0 Scena 2 Plecarea de pe P\u259?m\u226?nt\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Num\u259?r\u259?toare invers\u259? de zece secunde, apoi \u238?ncepe filmul. P\u259?m\u226?ntul r\u259?m\u226?ne \u238?n urm\u259?. Intervalul actual al filmului: 0\u8211?60 s.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs22\b\sb150\sa60\keepn C\u258?PITANUL    R12\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Pornire; pauz\u259? dup\u259? \u8222?Privi\u539?i spre stele\u8221?, apoi av\u226?nt.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs24\li240\sa180\sl300\slmult1\keep Valiza e la bord. Privi\u539?i spre stele. Pornim s\u259? vedem ce g\u259?sim.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs22\b\sb150\sa60\keepn AVATARUL AI    R13\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Siguran\u539?\u259? bl\u226?nd\u259?: \u8222?Eu \u539?in minte drumul \u238?napoi\u8221? e miezul.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs24\li240\sa180\sl300\slmult1\keep P\u259?m\u226?ntul r\u259?m\u226?ne \u238?n urm\u259?. Eu \u539?in minte drumul \u238?napoi. Acum putem privi \u238?n jur.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs22\b\sb150\sa60\keepn C\u258?PITANUL    R14\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Mirare juc\u259?u\u537?\u259?; gluma cu buzunarele, u\u537?or z\u226?mbit\u259?.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs24\li240\sa180\sl300\slmult1\keep Uite c\u226?te lumini! Dac\u259? a\u537? avea buzunare c\u226?t nava, tot n-ar \u238?nc\u259?pea toate.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs28\b\sb280\sa150\keepn\outlinelevel0 Scena 3 Lumea Luminii\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Prima oprire este Siwarha. Activitate: participantul recunoa\u537?te o form\u259? \u537?i atinge piesa potrivit\u259?. Fereastra actual\u259? a jocului: 96\u8211?120 s. Film: 60\u8211?144 s.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs22\b\sb150\sa60\keepn LUMINA    R15\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Voce de lume de lumin\u259?; \u8222?forma ei\u8221? plute\u537?te la final.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs24\li240\sa180\sl300\slmult1\keep Bun venit pe Siwarha. V-am g\u259?sit buc\u259?\u539?i pentru felinar. Fiecare are forma ei.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs22\b\sb150\sa60\keepn AVATARUL AI    R16\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Instruc\u539?iune clar\u259?; \u8222?Ai timp destul\u8221? spus foarte lini\u537?tit.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs24\li240\sa180\sl300\slmult1\keep Uit\u259?-te la forma mare de sus. Atinge bucata care seam\u259?n\u259? cu ea. Ai timp destul.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs22\b\sb150\sa60\keepn C\u258?PITANUL    R17\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Accent pe \u8222?valiza deschis\u259?\u8221?; \u8222?pe r\u226?nd\u8221? rar, r\u259?bd\u259?tor.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs24\li240\sa180\sl300\slmult1\keep Eu \u539?in valiza deschis\u259?. Buc\u259?\u539?ile pe care le g\u259?si\u539?i vin la mine, pe r\u226?nd.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Urm\u259?toarele trei replici sunt alternative. \u206?ntr-o reprezenta\u539?ie se roste\u537?te una singur\u259?, potrivit contribu\u539?iilor participan\u539?ilor.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs22\b\sb160\sa80\keepn Varianta A \u8212? To\u539?i participan\u539?ii activi au \u238?ncheiat activitatea\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs22\b\sb150\sa60\keepn LUMINA    R18\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Bucurie cresc\u226?nd\u259?; \u8222?Cum mai lumineaz\u259?!\u8221? e v\u226?rful replicii.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs24\li240\sa180\sl300\slmult1\keep Toate cele zece buc\u259?\u539?i sunt \u238?n valiz\u259?. Cercuri, aripi, frunze. Cum mai lumineaz\u259?!\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs22\b\sb160\sa80\keepn Varianta B \u8212? Exist\u259? contribu\u539?ii, dar activitatea nu este complet\u259? pentru to\u539?i\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs22\b\sb150\sa60\keepn LUMINA    R19\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Acceptare cald\u259?; \u8222?E bine \u537?i a\u537?a\u8221? spus foarte simplu.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs24\li240\sa180\sl300\slmult1\keep \u206?n valiz\u259? stau buc\u259?\u539?ile g\u259?site de voi. Restul locurilor r\u259?m\u226?n goale. E bine \u537?i a\u537?a.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs22\b\sb160\sa80\keepn Varianta C \u8212? Nu exist\u259? contribu\u539?ii la aceast\u259? activitate\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs22\b\sb150\sa60\keepn LUMINA    R20\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Consolare senin\u259?, f\u259?r\u259? regret; darul e oferit firesc.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs24\li240\sa180\sl300\slmult1\keep Valiza a r\u259?mas goal\u259?. V\u259? dau eu un cerc de lumin\u259? pentru drum.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs22\b\sb150\sa60\keepn C\u258?PITANUL    R21\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Mul\u539?umire scurt\u259?, apoi curiozitate pe \u8222?atelier nemaiv\u259?zut\u8221?.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs24\li240\sa180\sl300\slmult1\keep Mul\u539?umim. \u206?nchidem valiza cu grij\u259?. La urm\u259?toarea oprire e un atelier nemaiv\u259?zut.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs28\b\sb280\sa150\keepn\outlinelevel0 Scena 4 Atelierul Naturii\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Activitate: participantul rote\u537?te \u537?i a\u537?az\u259? piesa \u238?n contur. Piesele \u537?i lumina construiesc povestea felinarului. Fereastra actual\u259? a jocului: 204\u8211?224 s. Film: 144\u8211?246 s.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs22\b\sb150\sa60\keepn NATURA    R22\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Gazd\u259? primitoare; a doua propozi\u539?ie lini\u537?te\u537?te imediat.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs24\li240\sa180\sl300\slmult1\keep Aduce\u539?i piesele g\u259?site. Dac\u259? v\u259? lipse\u537?te o pies\u259?, v\u259? dau eu una din atelier.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs22\b\sb150\sa60\keepn AVATARUL AI    R23\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Doi pa\u537?i clari; pauz\u259? \u238?ntre \u8222?trage\u8221? \u537?i \u8222?atinge\u8221?.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs24\li240\sa180\sl300\slmult1\keep Pune piesa \u238?n conturul ei. O po\u539?i trage sau po\u539?i atinge piesa, apoi locul.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs22\b\sb150\sa60\keepn NATURA    R24\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Explica\u539?ie simpl\u259?; \u8222?una l\u226?ng\u259? alta\u8221? rostit rar.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs24\li240\sa180\sl300\slmult1\keep Fiecare fereastr\u259? are dou\u259? locuri. Piesele stau \u238?ntregi, una l\u226?ng\u259? alta.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Urm\u259?toarele trei replici sunt alternative. \u206?ntr-o reprezenta\u539?ie se roste\u537?te una singur\u259?, potrivit contribu\u539?iilor participan\u539?ilor.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs22\b\sb160\sa80\keepn Varianta A \u8212? To\u539?i participan\u539?ii activi au \u238?ncheiat activitatea\par}
