{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Reflexiv la \u238?nceput; ultima propozi\u539?ie deschide drumul \u238?nainte.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs24\li240\sa180\sl300\slmult1\keep Felinarul are deja ceva de povestit. Mai are nevoie de lumin\u259? ca s\u259? vin\u259? cu noi.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs28\b\sb280\sa150\keepn\outlinelevel0 Scena 5 Atelierul Mann\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Activitate: participantul rote\u537?te dou\u259? leg\u259?turi, \u238?nchide un circuit \u537?i aprinde becul. Fereastra actual\u259? a jocului: 323,5\u8211?355,5 s. Film: 246\u8211?388 s. Gaura neagr\u259? apare \u238?n acest segment al filmului; atelierul \u537?i c\u259?l\u259?toria fac parte din fic\u539?iunea experien\u539?ei.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs22\b\sb150\sa60\keepn TEHNOLOGICUL    R29\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Anun\u539? teatral; mic\u259? pauz\u259? hazlie \u238?nainte de \u8222?umbre\u8221?.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs24\li240\sa180\sl300\slmult1\keep Atelierul Mann e deschis! Repar\u259?m felinare, umbrele, c\u226?teodat\u259? umbre. Ce aduce\u539?i?\par}
