{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Instruc\u539?iune limpede; \u8222?Pe r\u226?nd e bine\u8221? lini\u537?titor.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs24\li240\sa180\sl300\slmult1\keep Pe tablet\u259? ai o baterie, un bec \u537?i dou\u259? leg\u259?turi. Rote\u537?te leg\u259?turile p\u226?n\u259? c\u226?nd firele se unesc. Atunci becul se aprinde.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f1\fs22\b\sb150\sa60\keepn TEHNOLOGICUL    R31\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [U\u537?or amuzat; \u8222?Firul are r\u259?bdare\u8221? spus cald, rar.]\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs24\li240\sa180\sl300\slmult1\keep Urm\u259?re\u537?te firul de la baterie, prin bec \u537?i \u238?napoi. Dac\u259? drumul e \u238?ntrerupt, mai rote\u537?te leg\u259?tura.\par}
{\pard\plain\widctlpar\f0\fs22\i\sa110\sl270\slmult1\keepn [Urm\u259?toarele trei replici sunt alternative. \u206?ntr-o reprezenta\u539?ie se roste\u537?te una singur\u259?, potrivit contribu\u539?iilor participan\u539?ilor.]\par}
